WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.000
Open the personal shortcut Record spending.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Tap Edit to open the action editor.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Open the name menu at the top and choose Add to Home Screen.

4
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Check the name and icon, then tap the checkmark to add it.

5
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:32.500
Tap Record spending on the Home Screen.

6
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.500
Enter the description and amount, for example Lunch $12.80.

7
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:45.500
Tap Done and check the amount in the confirmation.

8
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:50.467
Open Kotori to review the pending entry.
